---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — GOATSBattle" description="How GOATSBattle collects, uses, and protects account and participation data.">
  <section class="page-container py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-lime">Effective 13 July 2026</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-headline font-black uppercase text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 font-sans text-body leading-relaxed">GOATSBattle collects only the information needed to run accounts, discussions, voting, safety, and basic audience measurement.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-sans text-body leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Information we collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Account data may include your name, email address, username, profile image, authentication-provider identifiers, and session records. Participation data includes votes, comments, replies, upvotes, reports, and the timestamps attached to them. We may also process shortened or hashed network identifiers for rate limiting, fraud prevention, and security.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">How we use it</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We use this information to authenticate you, display the actions you choose to make public, prevent abuse, investigate reports, maintain service reliability, and understand aggregate product usage. We do not sell personal information.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Service providers</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We use infrastructure and authentication providers, including Cloudflare, Neon, and Google, to operate the service. Those providers process information under their own terms and privacy policies. Audience measurement is configured without advertising profiles.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Retention and choices</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We retain account and participation data while it is needed to operate the service, enforce rules, or meet legal obligations. Deleted comments may retain limited records needed for thread integrity and abuse prevention. You may request access, correction, or deletion by emailing <a class="text-lime hover:underline" href="mailto:contact@goatsbattle.com">contact@goatsbattle.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Changes</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We may update this policy as the product changes. Material updates will be identified by a new effective date on this page.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
